            "review_title": "Review at Al Fresco's",
            "review_text": "David M\nCorona, California46 contributions\n0\nNice surprize\nJul 2022\nFamily was tired of Pho, noodles and rice. Wanted something different, walked around hotel area, found this place. Kids said okay to pizza even if its not from our local place at home. Went on tues afternoon, ordered a peperoni pizza and come to find out it, it was 2 for 1 day. So, got a BBQ chicken pizza to boot. Price for XL was about 300k dong, but for 2, all the more better. Waited 20 mins for them to cook it, walked it back to hotel, family chowed down. We enjoyed it, asked staff for plastic plates and napkins, was all good. Would recommend.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 21, 2022",
